---
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-container">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">
      <span class="pulse"></span>
      <span class="micro">EU CBAM &middot; Definitive period 2026&ndash;2034 &middot; Iron &amp; steel, cement, aluminium, fertilisers, hydrogen, electricity</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="display hero-headline">
      Reading the fine print<br />of the <em>EU carbon border</em>.
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-lede">
      <strong>CarbonLenz</strong> is an AI CBAM evidence scanner for EU importers. It reads messy supplier emissions evidence, extracts the CBAM fields, flags what's missing, and shows whether relying on EU default values is costing the importer money — from 2026 through 2034. Nobody else does this.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-meta">
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <span class="micro">Product</span>
        <span class="hero-meta-value">AI CBAM Evidence Scanner</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <span class="micro">Stage</span>
        <span class="hero-meta-value">MVP shipping July 2026</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <span class="micro">Coverage</span>
        <span class="hero-meta-value">Iron &amp; steel · India · CN 7208</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <span class="micro">Demo</span>
        <span class="hero-meta-value">carbonlenz.com</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 100px;
    padding-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .hero-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .hero-headline {
    font-size: clamp(72px, 12vw, 180px);
    line-height: 0.86;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    max-width: 14ch;
  }

  .hero-lede {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .hero-lede strong {
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero-meta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 24px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .hero-meta-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .hero-meta-value {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-mono);
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-meta {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    .hero-headline {
      font-size: clamp(48px, 12vw, 180px);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero-meta {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
